  "notes": "Three copies of the same pinout over a back-label illustration (ESP32-Touch-LCD-3.5). Labels use the GPIO name inside parentheses with the prefix (DN, DP) in functions. Pin 8 is printed 'DP(DPIO14)' (likely typo for GPIO14); recorded as printed. EXIO3-EXIO7 use the letter O (expander IO). The small G/3V3/BAT/5V boxes partly hidden at the edges of the illustration are not legible as separate connectors and are skipped."
